to me

Do these in two parts: GitHub for code and Docker Hub for vLLM image.


1. Push your AQI project code to GitHub


Go to your project folder

cd ~/Projects/AQI/aqi-assistant

Check what is inside

ls -la

Initialize git if not already done

git init

Create a 
.gitignore


Use this so you do not push caches, audio files, env files, or big model artifacts.

cat > .gitignore << 'EOF'
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.swp
*.swo

.env
.env.*
.venv/
venv/

static/audio/
*.wav
*.mp3

.cache/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

*.log

runtime/
models/
*.gguf
mmproj*.gguf

node_modules/

.DS_Store
EOF
